> offers you to turn to the right.
> Turn the picture 180 degrees. And you'll see something as if you were 
> standing on your head. Now the sign offers you to turn to the left.
>
> So we have to use "line of sight" concept in the definitions anyway. 
> Either in notes to those definitions or in a separate explanatory 
> dictionary of lojban gismu.
